  "content": "\n\n<p><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/refs/heads/1.21.7/assets/title.png\" alt=\"Instrumental 標誌\"></p>\n<hr>\n<p>引入了多種樂器物品/方塊，為你的世界增添音樂</p>\n<p>總共有 3 種物品（吉他、排笛和豎琴）以及 1 個方塊（鼓）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"物品\"></p>\n<p>要演奏樂器物品時，請將準星對準你想彈奏的音符，然後按右鍵。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/holding_item.png?raw=true\" alt=\"手持物品\"></p>\n<p>你甚至同時演奏兩件樂器！（別問它是怎麼運作的）</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/two_items.png?raw=true\" alt=\"同時手持兩件物品\"></p>\n<p>你也可以與鼓互動來敲擊它，蹲下時會敲擊鼓的側面。\n如果你只想敲擊側面，只需將其放置在彩釉陶土上方即可</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://github.com/DaBananaCat/Instrumental/blob/1.21.7/assets/drum.png?raw=true\" alt=\"鼓方塊\"></p>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fbisecthosting.com%252fSir_BananaCat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://www.bisecthosting.com/partners/custom-banners/e41722d0-0895-4da9-9b57-9085dc221a2f.webp\" alt=\"Bisect Hosting 廣告\"></a></p>",
